soroban-groth16-verifier

The BN254 pairing verification structure in contracts/proof-verifier/src/lib.rs
is adapted from stellar/soroban-examples, groth16_verifier, revision
03d42aa6b973dcf3a453a99d0c6a6e8d25a196e2.
Source: https://github.com/stellar/soroban-examples
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (included in LICENSE).

Changes include a fixed Circom/snarkjs verification key, one canonical public
scalar, explicit infinity rejection and synthetic multiplication test vectors.
